    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever; energy returning</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Wounds healed; no redness or fluid</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild tightness raising the left arm; knee stiffness unchanged; no bone pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Small patch of numbness on the inner left upper arm</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No indigestion or black stools off omeprazole</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Some worry about the lymph nodes, sleeping better; PHQ-9 4, GAD-7 5</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

