  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Invasive ductal carcinoma of the left breast, upper outer quadrant at 2 o&apos;clock, 2.4 cm on imaging; core biopsy grade 2, estrogen and progesterone receptor positive, HER2 negative, Ki-67 22 percent; clinical stage T2 N0 (cT2 cN0 M0); synthetic modern counterpart of the documented 1960 breast cancer, which was not disclosed to her</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
