  <tr ID="problem-4">
    <td>Duodenal ulcer found at endoscopy seven weeks ago, with Helicobacter pylori on biopsy; treated with 14 days of bismuth quadruple therapy and completing eight weeks of omeprazole; test of cure planned</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>K26.9</td><td>S — Synthetic modern ulcer; it echoes the ulcer among her documented illnesses, which the sources do not date.</td>
