  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-6">
    <td>Metastatic carcinoma in two of three left axillary sentinel lymph nodes (macrometastases, no extranodal extension); pathologic stage pT2 pN1a(sn) M0, anatomic stage IIB; recurrence score 17</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>C77.3</td><td>S — Synthetic surgical pathology; spread to lymph nodes is documented later in her life, but no pathology from her lifetime is used.</td>
